// The project entry point named by birnam.toml `main`. Bare `birnam` in this
// directory runs this before the REPL. It reads its own config back through the
// `Config` singleton (which parses ./birnam.toml with the self-hosted Toml module).
[System println: ["starting " , [[Config at: "name"] , [" v" , [Config at: "version"]]]]];
[System println: "(edit birnam.toml to change name/version; run `birnam` here to see it)"]
